A first-block marker on an indented opener reads only its marker column

```
- foo
  - +
- x
.
<ul>
  <li>foo
    <ul>
      <li>+</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li>x</li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
+
- b
.
<ul>
  <li>a
+</li>
  <li>b</li>
</ul>
```

